    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, the hunter didn't defeat the monster."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the villagers had left, leaving behind only empty ruins to burn in the flames."
    },
    {
        "text": "Wounded and without a target, the monster roared and bellowed, and returned to the forest on its own."
    },
    {
        "text": "As though leaving with the parting words:"
    },
    {
        "text": "'I'll be back.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The hunter stands quietly facing the forest. A long time passes before he answers."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.8,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? The hunter doesn't beat the monster? Lame!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mischievous Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, he's the greatest hunter in the village! Why couldn't he beat the monster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Curious Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's just how the story goes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Rathalos that attacked the village got away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Curious Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's 'cause they were all too weak. When <i>I</i> become a hunter, I'll chase that Rathalos away in the blink of an eye!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mischievous Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_756_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut it out! I saw it with my own eyes. You're no match for it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_756_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look! What do you think this is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The spear used to hunt the Rathalos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mischievous Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_756_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato told me to take care of it for now, which means I'm worthy of carrying it. I'm the one who's gonna be the greatest hunter in the whole village. You just go home and sleep!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kazuya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "I dare you to say that again! Spirit Helm Breaker! Take that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mischievous Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, kids, that's enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did the hunter say in the end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Curious Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time for lunch. Go eat, and I'll continue the hunter's story afterwards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$runsand"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mirai... it's already been half a month, but sometimes it feels like it was yesterday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your memory is improving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've never forgotten about Akira... Is old Kashiwau awake?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still in a coma, but the doctor says he's gotten a lot better. He has a lot of life in him yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things have been so busy lately, new streets and new houses...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing we'd saved up some money from the Originium mining, and made Hiroshi Ritou cough up the money he embezzled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "The beginning is the easy part though. The question is what kind of industry should the village pursue...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mirai, can't we try the Suzuka cultivation method you mentioned, once things have settled down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I was lying about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "L-Lying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know how sensitive Suzuka herbs are. It's not really feasible to cultivate them outside their native habitat with current technology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you said\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You guys would never have been willing to move if I didn't. You lost your wits in the face of danger and Ritou played you like a fiddle. I had to find a way to get people to leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The future... Just thinking about the livelihood of the village is making my head hurt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, I do have an idea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead then, I'm listening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can make use of our experience working in the mines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can have our people go out to work in mature Originium projects and bring back safe, established technologies relying on existing supply chains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you realize what you're saying? We finally managed to escape that Originium mine, and now you're trying to send us back in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weren't you one who wanted to blow it up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't about the mine itself, but the fact that you were digging up more than you could manage, and none of you would listen to reason.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been working directly with Originium ore for so long and gained so much experience. That can only come in handy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium is too dangerous. Catastrophe, Oripathy... are we really going to go back to living in fear?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, Uncle, there's nowhere in Terra we can avoid living alongside Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bright lights of the great cities are fueled by the Originium industry, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late to turn our backs on it and go back to the old ways.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... how <i>can</i> we...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Starting over doesn't mean abandoning everything we once had.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What we know about the Originium industry is just the tip of the iceberg. We need to move forward, learn from mature industrial systems, and gain more experience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll learn to benefit from Originium in a safe, controlled manner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We brought this disaster on ourselves because of our short-sightedness, but that doesn't mean we have to abandon the idea entirely.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "On the contrary, we must learn to <i>respect</i> Originium and respect the destruction it can cause, in order to fully enjoy the opportunities that it brings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We shouldn't let the sacrifices of the past go to waste. Besides, we have our friends from Rhodes Island helping us now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. I should think about the village's future in more practical terms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium industry... I don't know how much of our existing experience will apply, but like you said, it's worth a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when the situation in the village improves, can you build me a beautiful lab with the latest technologies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? What are you planning?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To cultivate Suzuka outside its native habitat, of course. Along with other research, with the aim of breaking free from a reliance on Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To bring us closer to a day when we won't have to cower in the shadow of disaster, when we can stand tall and look towards the light...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Towards tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
