        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$leaveshake",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I'm still worried, Yato. What if the Doctor finds out that we took a detour here on our way back from the mission?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you going to tell them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here we are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow... Everything really was destroyed by the Catastrophe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The whole hill was reduced to ashes. And those ashes rose into the clouds and continue to fall even now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How long has it been, Corne?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Half a month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Already? Feels like it happened yesterday.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard the Felynes have been integrated into Rhodes Island?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The official name is the Felyne Task Force, led by the Palico, but the Scholar insists on calling it the Terra Research Commission and claims to be the leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They deal with unusual lifeforms, record the flora and fauna of Terra... and look for a way home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Palico added that last bit, because apparently Arty and Scholar have completely forgotten about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yeah, I can imagine the Scholar's excitement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rebuilding of Roka is underway too. Everything's getting better, don't worry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... do you know why I came here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to reminisce about the past, that's for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know me so well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember the Rathalos?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... the monitoring report says it hasn't left the Soubo Mountains. It can be seen circling them amidst the cloud of ashes from time to time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It won't be easy to spot it from a place like this. Lemme take a look...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's right there, up in the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where? Oh, I see it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I came to...",
